Package: ggtypst
Title: Render High-Quality Text and Formulas in 'ggplot2' by 'Typst'
Version: 0.2.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Hao",
           family = "Cheng",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
